..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : ENTSPERREN.BSTART.BV
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Functionality  : Builds the query description for visualizing the blocked
.. documents in the table of the infosystem "Cancel document blocks".
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Initializations
.assign M|select = "$,,"
.formula M|select = M|select + ";ktyp==" + 'F|condexpr(M|verkauf, M|vkvorgangnum, M|ekvorgangnum)'
.formula M|select = M|select + ";vsperre==" + 'M|kvsperre'
.formula M|select = M|select + ";faktura==" + 'G|TRUE' ? M|kfaktura
.formula M|select = M|select + ";@ablageart=" + F|value(M|ablageart, "AS193")
..
.. Clear table
.make screen line -- ? M|tzeilen > 0
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
